    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway data collected from R/V Sikuliaq Expeditions in the North Pacific Ocean, Gulf of Alaska, Bering Sea, Chukchi Sea and Arctic Ocean from 2020-03-21 to 2020-12-12. These data include partial pressure carbon dioxide (pCO2) - air, partial pressure carbon dioxide (pCO2) - water, sea surface salinity, sea surface temperature and barometric pressure. The instruments used to collect these data include Carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer and shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.",
